{
  "description": "How much of a sold line may come back, and its refund (POS-12, PRD W6 steps 2 and 4, D-005, posting rules §4.2). A line is the original as sold: its quantity (thousandths, above 0) and its lineTotal (what the customer paid for it, after its share of the bill discount). `returned` is what earlier returns of that line took (quantity and refund, both positive). Returnable = sold − returned, worth lineTotal − refunds so far. The refund for k of the r units left is round(value × k / r), half away from zero; all that is left refunds exactly what is left, so a line returned in parts adds up to what was paid. Errors: invalid_quantity (0 or less), return_over_quantity (more than is left).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "the whole line comes back: what was paid",
      "input": {
        "line": {
          "lineNo": 1,
          "itemId": "019a0000-0000-7000-8000-0000000000c1",
          "qty": 1000,
          "lineTotal": 435000
        },
        "returned": {
          "qty": 0,
          "refund": 0
        },
        "qty": 1000
      },
      "expected": {
        "returnable": {
          "qty": 1000,
          "value": 435000
        },
        "refund": 435000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2 of 3 filters (Rs 10,000 for 3): Rs 6,666.67",
      "input": {
        "line": {
          "lineNo": 2,
          "itemId": "019a0000-0000-7000-8000-0000000000c3",
          "qty": 3000,
          "lineTotal": 1000000
        },
        "returned": {
          "qty": 0,
          "refund": 0
        },
        "qty": 2000
      },
      "expected": {
        "returnable": {
          "qty": 3000,
          "value": 1000000
        },
        "refund": 666667
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "then the last one: Rs 3,333.33, so the parts add up to Rs 10,000",
      "input": {
        "line": {
          "lineNo": 2,
          "itemId": "019a0000-0000-7000-8000-0000000000c3",
          "qty": 3000,
          "lineTotal": 1000000
        },
        "returned": {
          "qty": 2000,
          "refund": 666667
        },
        "qty": 1000
      },
      "expected": {
        "returnable": {
          "qty": 1000,
          "value": 333333
        },
        "refund": 333333
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "1 of 3, then 1 of the 2 left: Rs 6,666.67 / 2 rounds half away from zero",
      "input": {
        "line": {
          "lineNo": 2,
          "itemId": "019a0000-0000-7000-8000-0000000000c3",
          "qty": 3000,
          "lineTotal": 1000000
        },
        "returned": {
          "qty": 1000,
          "refund": 333333
        },
        "qty": 1000
      },
      "expected": {
        "returnable": {
          "qty": 2000,
          "value": 666667
        },
        "refund": 333334
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a line that took a share of the bill discount refunds its net, not its price",
      "input": {
        "line": {
          "lineNo": 3,
          "itemId": "019a0000-0000-7000-8000-0000000000c2",
          "qty": 2000,
          "lineTotal": 869999
        },
        "returned": {
          "qty": 0,
          "refund": 0
        },
        "qty": 1000
      },
      "expected": {
        "returnable": {
          "qty": 2000,
          "value": 869999
        },
        "refund": 435000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "half a metre of 1.5 m of hose (Rs 499.50)",
      "input": {
        "line": {
          "lineNo": 4,
          "itemId": "019a0000-0000-7000-8000-0000000000c4",
          "qty": 1500,
          "lineTotal": 49950
        },
        "returned": {
          "qty": 0,
          "refund": 0
        },
        "qty": 500
      },
      "expected": {
